servers/README.md:109:| Every receipt withheld, `Checker: UNIDENTIFIED`; 17 receipt/replay/checker-identity gates fail under concrete-remote (Arch gate host) | Arch keeps `shasum` in `/usr/bin/core_perl`, added only by login shells; concrete-remote's non-login ssh and `nix develop` inherit the pam_env PATH | `base-arch.sh`: perl bin dirs in `/etc/environment` PATH; `shasum` checked by the runner preflight and by `dev-home.sh` in dev's ssh environment |
